{"type":"json_object","final":{"answer":"The net change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from the fiscal year ended December 29, 2007 to the fiscal year ended December 27, 2008 is an increase of $87.8 million.","value":87.8,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t1c0","source:t8c0","source:t0c1","source:t0c2"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"2008 year-end balance ($214.4 million) minus 2007 year-end balance ($126.6 million) = $87.8 million increase."}}